                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c31e4337-75ba-3672-8a4f-2ba33c04a5bb",
                        "entry_id": "47a746a7-f67d-3c95-89ce-752715d322f6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "rzecz. odczas. od myśleć"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "460bd1f2-aea3-4886-8bbe-ebe5cc69a20a",
                                "sense_id": "c31e4337-75ba-3672-8a4f-2ba33c04a5bb",
                                "text": "Racjonaliści przyjmują tylko te spośród elementów wiedzy i wierzeń, które dają się uzasadnić na podstawie czysto logicznego myślenia oraz empirycznego poznania"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9086e4a5-c369-4d25-a8a9-fc0210e12fc2",
                        "source_entry_id": "47a746a7-f67d-3c95-89ce-752715d322f6",
                        "source_sense_id": "c31e4337-75ba-3672-8a4f-2ba33c04a5bb",
                        "target_lang_word": "thinking",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thinking",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46641358-fdb8-357a-b185-754c0ecffb4b",
                                        "entry_id": "75c0bf5b-d84c-3f8f-9d0d-6817c16987ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Thought; gerund of think."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b10c90d7-eadd-4a10-be8a-4536bc656ee8",
                                                "sense_id": "46641358-fdb8-357a-b185-754c0ecffb4b",
                                                "text": "What is your thinking on this subject?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dda3e28-1fab-49ea-9bfd-388b8db04fe0",
                                                "sense_id": "46641358-fdb8-357a-b185-754c0ecffb4b",
                                                "text": "But how the neurons are organised in these lobes and ganglia remains obscure. Yet this is the level of organisation that does the actual thinking—and is, presumably, the seat of consciousness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "366654e1-e905-4341-9eb4-dd985d23285d",
                                                "sense_id": "46641358-fdb8-357a-b185-754c0ecffb4b",
                                                "text": "When BR \"back-checked\" (BR's term) the financial results of steam replacement across 49 schemes, where DMUs had been substituted on the London Midland Region, only one was now profitable. BR thinking on such substitutions referred to \"betterment\", not profit or loss."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "thinking",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46858d80-b480-3dd1-8f86-f5af0e7ea295",
                                        "entry_id": "a15c4c95-47f2-3cd8-a0e0-64d57b28c6d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of think"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b03287b-bf63-4ba6-96e9-60ea25dc952b",
                                                "sense_id": "46858d80-b480-3dd1-8f86-f5af0e7ea295",
                                                "text": "I'm thinking about inventing a new perpetual-motion machine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae28c82c-d390-43e5-9a18-f7b6b3bfc324",
                                                "sense_id": "46858d80-b480-3dd1-8f86-f5af0e7ea295",
                                                "text": "He was thinking; but the glory of the song, the swell from the great organ, the clustered lights, […], the height and vastness of this noble fane, its antiquity and its strength—all these things seemed to have their part as causes of the thrilling emotion that accompanied his thoughts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e2f44692-fcb7-4cb6-87fd-77859ee8debf",
                        "source_entry_id": "47a746a7-f67d-3c95-89ce-752715d322f6",
                        "source_sense_id": "c31e4337-75ba-3672-8a4f-2ba33c04a5bb",
                        "target_lang_word": "pensamiento",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pensamiento",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d4fdeb2-55cb-3bde-8564-f6dcdbc230e7",
                                        "entry_id": "5ba5a30c-4787-3aee-9c8b-68f397f9ce72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Potencia o facultad de pensar."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aef47e02-595f-436e-8b4d-2991f8c0908e",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4fdeb2-55cb-3bde-8564-f6dcdbc230e7",
                                                "text": "«A simple vista, podría parecer que el pensamiento es independiente del lenguaje: después de todo, los seres humanos parecen ser capaces de idear y soñar sin necesidad de articular palabras»."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e76144c-223d-4012-9ab4-c94c403fc36a",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4fdeb2-55cb-3bde-8564-f6dcdbc230e7",
                                                "text": "«Seguramente el enfoque experimental que ha producido tan importantes resultados en el área de la percepción y del aprendizaje producirá resultados similares en el área del pensamiento y de la personalidad, cuando sus métodos se refinen suficientemente»."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4db9b0de-2ce8-33ee-bbd2-52c9601b205b",
                                        "entry_id": "5ba5a30c-4787-3aee-9c8b-68f397f9ce72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acción y efecto de pensar."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3f9ba33-a6cc-4d13-8a7a-d0b9819a50df",
                                                "sense_id": "4db9b0de-2ce8-33ee-bbd2-52c9601b205b",
                                                "text": "«“Es una entidad que siente mis pensamientos y piensa mi miedo”, advierte él»."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a6baf60-3a0d-4038-bd98-58e3cbfba698",
                                                "sense_id": "4db9b0de-2ce8-33ee-bbd2-52c9601b205b",
                                                "text": "«Este pensamiento estaba apoyado en el hecho de que meses atrás, había sido destruida la armada inglesa en casi su totalidad, únicamente con el esfuerzo de las milicias de la Compañía y de los locales, sin requerir ayuda de otras regiones»."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "727393d3-5a62-36b9-97bb-fab0125fda4e",
                                        "entry_id": "5ba5a30c-4787-3aee-9c8b-68f397f9ce72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Idea inicial o capital de una obra cualquiera."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1644dbb-df1c-3d75-9ce0-8989bcbf54d2",
                                        "entry_id": "5ba5a30c-4787-3aee-9c8b-68f397f9ce72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cada una de las ideas o sentencias notables de un escrito."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                                    },
                                    {
